flowchart LR
  subgraph UNTRUSTED[Untrusted zone · can be wrong, offline or compromised]
    AI[D · AI reasoning<br/>explains · answers · nominates options<br/>no write access of any kind]
  end
  subgraph DET[Deterministic zone · on the iPhone · unit-testable]
    A[A · Ingestion and provenance<br/>source · time · trust · freshness]
    B[B · Athlete state<br/>versioned · declared vs measured]
    C[C · Deterministic analysis<br/>eligibility · fatigue proxies · gaps]
    E[E · Typed proposal / action]
    F[F · Independent policy engine<br/>allowlist · hard limits · consent]
    G[G · Plan validator<br/>whole schedule re-checked]
    H[H · Transactional persistence<br/>pending → committed / failed / unknown]
  end
  I[I · Experience<br/>timeline · ask · approvals · undo · fueling]
  J[(J · Decision log and versions)]
  A --> B --> C
  C -->|candidates with evidence| E
  C -. read-only snapshot, redacted .-> AI
  AI -. structured text, parsed and bounded .-> E
  E --> F
  F -->|auto-eligible: rule-generated only| G
  F -->|needs approval| I
  I -->|approve · reject · undo| F
  G -->|valid| H
  G -->|invalid: reasons and ways forward| I
  H --> J
  H --> I
  F --> J
